<!--
  LINE Notify+ v1.1 notification status-bar icon (24dp)

  v1 Original design scaled UNIFORMLY 1.1x — bubble, plus, AND gear all
  grow together by the same factor, around canvas center (12, 12).

  This preserves all original proportions:
    - bubble:gear size ratio (1:1 scaling on both)
    - bubble-to-gear relative distance
    - gear's "planet belt" position relative to bubble

  Notes:
    - 12 o'clock top-notch from M12,3 -> (12,4) -> z is preserved
    - Notification gear hub already at gear-center (M19.5 matches gear-x-center) -
      no path fix needed (unlike the launcher gear)
    - Green "+" is kept for source consistency; Android tints to white at runtime
-->
